  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XgH4EpyPD2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1321365/description_19767e94-ef82-4569-92c6-b1e8b60e6e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>\n<h1><strong>Cursed View 并非普通的着色器包。</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/50c0cdf0e12fbe2311222b044cf09d55c0187980_0.webp\" alt=\"Example Image\"></p>\n<p>这款着色器旨在刻意打破《我的世界》的视觉常规。<br>\n它不追求美感或真实感，而是毫不犹豫地投身于混乱、扭曲与不适之中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p>使用 Cursed View，你将体验到：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过度曝光的光照，将你的世界笼罩在刺眼的光芒中</li>\n<li>相互冲突、仿佛彼此争斗的色彩</li>\n<li>行为异常的阴影</li>\n<li>感觉不对劲、扭曲甚至近乎损坏的方块和实体</li>\n<li>一种超现实的氛围，将宁静的村庄变成被诅咒的区域</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/037197020dba3112a511234ca2378c44b53b3e07.png\" alt=\"Example Image\"></p>\n<p>目标很简单：让《我的世界》看起来<em>错误</em>——而且诡异得令人着迷。<br>\n无论你是正在探索故障艺术（glitchcore）建筑、录制诅咒主题视频，还是仅仅想挑战你的感知，<br>\nCursed View 都能提供一种“正常”着色器不敢尝试的体验。</p>\n<p>它不以美观为目标。<br>\n它不以可玩性为目标。<br>\n它的存在是为了干扰、困惑，有时甚至带来乐趣。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐视场角（FOV）：Quake Pro</strong> ——以完全拥抱这种疯狂。</p>\n<p>如果你曾想过，<br>\n<strong><em>“如果一个着色器讨厌你，会怎样？”</em></strong> ——这就是答案。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fxsoras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f7d0d642a94e503b0efdbc6a69a36cbbb8b6663.png\" alt=\"Use code\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/656273342c192b